<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-associated-materials> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Ontology> .
<https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-associated-materials> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#versionIRI> <https://w3id.org/eudpp/textile-associated-materials/1.1.2> .
